* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.pdf binary

# Lane 0.7l (docs/design/ASSETS.md 0.7): the game's binaries under art/ live in Git LFS. Recipes (*.recipe.json) and
# the licence notes stay ordinary text. tools/lfs-check.ts reads these lines: a binary under art/ that is not an LFS
# pointer is refused by the pre-commit hook and by CI.
art/**/*.png filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
art/**/*.webp filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
art/**/*.jpg filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
art/**/*.wav filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
art/**/*.ogg filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
art/**/*.flac filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
art/**/*.ttf filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
art/**/*.otf filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
art/**/*.woff2 filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
